            "text": "Each fixture now starts a fresh generation so embedded-font diagnostics are row-scoped facts, not worker-cumulative state. This makes the persisted counts and final font representations directly attributable to the fixture without subtracting a prior workerSeq record.",
            "markdown": "Each fixture now starts a fresh generation so embedded-font diagnostics are row-scoped facts, not worker-cumulative state. This makes the persisted counts and final font representations directly attributable to the fixture without subtracting a prior workerSeq record."
